# Seminormal and absolutely weakly normal schemes, affine-locally

Seminormality and absolute weak normality of a scheme can be checked on every affine open, on
one affine open covering, or on an open covering by subschemes with the property; and both pass
to every open subscheme. These four statements, `AlgebraicGeometry.isSeminormal_tfae`,
`AlgebraicGeometry.isSeminormal_open`, `AlgebraicGeometry.isAbsolutelyWeaklyNormal_tfae` and
`AlgebraicGeometry.isAbsolutelyWeaklyNormal_open`, are proved in
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Morphisms.DifferentialsAndValuative.SeminormalLocalCriteria` and
re-exported here.

